cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite the accompanying paper (reference to be added) and this release."
title: "earth-albedo-xgamma: the X- and gamma-ray emission of the Earth, 1 keV-10 MeV"
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Campana
    given-names: Riccardo
    affiliation: "INAF/OAS Bologna"
abstract: >-
  Emergent intensity of the Earth's atmosphere from 1 keV to 10 MeV, from Geant4 simulations: reflection of the
  cosmic X-ray background and emission induced by galactic cosmic rays, tabulated against photon energy and impact
  parameter, with the response functions of the standard production, IGRF cutoff grids and reference orbits.
keywords:
  - Earth albedo
  - cosmic X-ray background
  - cosmic rays
  - gamma rays
  - instrumental background
  - Geant4
